<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Bengali interface strings.

  The doctor directory itself stays English, and that is a data fact rather than a
  shortcut: the scrape carries no Bengali for doctor names, chamber names, degrees
  or addresses (0.0% of each), and about_bn is the only Bengali the source
  publishes. Translating a chamber address would also make it harder to find, not
  easier, and MBBS/FCPS are written in Latin script in Bangladeshi practice.

  So this file localises the app, not the data. Department and family names are the
  one exception - they are a closed vocabulary the app owns, and they live here too.
-->
